# {{name_title}}

A 2D platformer game built with the Game Engine.

## Features

- 2D platforming physics
- Tile-based level system
- Sprite animation
- Player controller
- Collision detection
- Enemy AI

## Getting Started

### Building

```bash
cargo build
cargo run
```

## Game Controls

- Arrow Keys / WASD: Move
- Space: Jump
- Shift: Run

## Level Design

Levels are defined in JSON format in the `assets/levels/` directory.

Example level structure:

```json
{
  "name": "Level 1",
  "width": 32,
  "height": 18,
  "tiles": [
    { "type": "ground", "x": 0, "y": 16, "width": 32, "height": 2 },
    { "type": "platform", "x": 5, "y": 12, "width": 6, "height": 1 }
  ],
  "entities": [
    { "type": "player", "x": 2, "y": 14 },
    { "type": "enemy", "x": 10, "y": 14 }
  ]
}
```

## Assets

Place your sprites and textures in `assets/sprites/` and `assets/textures/`.

